              <description align="center" color="transparent" colored="true" height="354" resized="false" width="178" x="347" y="331">&lt;br&gt; The optimizer, powered by GEKKO, processes model parameters, constraints, and objectives to solve MINLP and continuous optimization problems. It adjusts variables while ensuring constraints are met to optimize the objective function efficiently&lt;br&gt;.&lt;br&gt;I/P 1: Timestamps&lt;br&gt;I/P 2: solver settings&lt;br&gt;I/P 3: parameters&lt;br&gt;I/P 4: variables&lt;br&gt;I/P 5: Constraints&lt;br&gt;I/P 6: Objective</description>
