          <description align="center" color="green" colored="true" height="728" resized="true" width="279" x="78" y="26">Initialization Stage&lt;br&gt;Read tables, make pi and sql connections,data ingestion</description>
          <description align="center" color="orange" colored="true" height="726" resized="true" width="137" x="356" y="28">Data enrichment&lt;br&gt;Data imputation, inferred calculation, inferred imputation, iterative inferred, value adjustment</description>
          <description align="center" color="transparent" colored="true" height="420" resized="false" width="111" x="370" y="304">Perform PI tag imputation&lt;br&gt;Inferred tag calculation&lt;br&gt;Inferred tag imputation&lt;br&gt;iterative inferred&lt;br&gt;value adjustment&lt;br&gt;I/P 1: PI data&lt;br&gt;O/P 1: Current data&lt;br&gt;O/P 2: model alert&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stored:&lt;br&gt;1. peeo_&lt;br&gt;optimum_data&lt;br&gt;2. adjusted_&lt;br&gt;actual_value&lt;br&gt;3. current_data&lt;br&gt;</description>
          <description align="center" color="green" colored="true" height="721" resized="true" width="127" x="496" y="30">Data validation&lt;br&gt;Parameter nan check, mode skip check</description>
          <description align="center" color="gray" colored="true" height="719" resized="true" width="137" x="626" y="30">Data transformation&lt;br/&gt;Execute moving average</description>
          <description align="center" color="purple" colored="true" height="721" resized="true" width="124" x="766" y="28">Optimizer model</description>
          <description align="center" color="transparent" colored="true" height="409" resized="false" width="124" x="749" y="368">is_model_live&amp;gt;1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Optimizer Model to find optimum values, SEU calculation&lt;br&gt;I/P 1: Current data&lt;br&gt;I/P 2: Model alert&lt;br&gt;I/P 3:model status&lt;br&gt;O/P 1: Model status&lt;br&gt;O/P 2: Model alert&lt;br&gt;O/P 3: Actual data&lt;br&gt;O/P 4: optimum data&lt;br&gt;Stored:&lt;br&gt;1. seu_output&lt;br&gt;2. seec_overview_&lt;br&gt;output&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
          <description align="center" color="orange" colored="true" height="721" resized="true" width="126" x="892" y="28">Post optimizer&lt;br&gt;</description>
          <description align="center" color="green" colored="true" height="716" resized="true" width="133" x="1020" y="30">Operation decision support</description>
          <description align="center" color="gray" colored="true" height="720" resized="true" width="245" x="1154" y="26">Prepare output</description>
          <description align="center" color="transparent" colored="true" height="319" resized="false" width="192" x="1184" y="380">Prepare output according to output tables to store data in them&lt;br&gt;I/P 1: Run info&lt;br&gt;I/P 2: Model alert&lt;br&gt;I/P 3: Model output&lt;br&gt;I/P 4: ODS output&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;O/P 1: Run info&lt;br&gt;O/P 2: Model alert&lt;br&gt;O/P 3: Model output&lt;br&gt;O/P 4: ODS output&lt;br&gt;O/P 5: peeo_ods&lt;br&gt;O/P 6: Non SEU Pi Output&lt;br&gt;O/P 7: Equipment availability&lt;br&gt;O/P 8: Last good value</description>
          <description align="center" color="transparent" colored="true" height="202" resized="false" width="132" x="91" y="289">Can input manually like case id if wants to run process independently.&lt;br&gt;Input macros&lt;br&gt;I/P 1: end_time&lt;br&gt;I/P 2: case_id&lt;br&gt;I/P 3: pullpi_window_hour&lt;br&gt;</description>
        </process>
